Farmers > Website
Farmers > Basic phone menu and SMS
Insurance agents > Website: apply for farmers
Insurance company > Website: approve and set prices
Veterinarians > Website: confirm cattle deaths
Government > Website: fund premium support

Website > Insurance service
Basic phone menu and SMS <> Insurance service: menus and text alerts
Insurance service <> Tamper-proof shared record: saves every policy, claim and payment
Weather and satellite data > Weather and crop checker
Weather and crop checker > Tamper-proof shared record: rainfall and crop health
Insurance service <> MTN Mobile Money: collect premiums, send payouts
